{% set mailSubject = "Getting involved with Envision Education" | urlencode %}
<section class="donate-hero">
  <img src="{{ '11062b_560805ef563246db96e8ecec2d701f6f' | img }}" alt="">
  <div class="donate-hero__text">
    <h1 class="display">GET INVOLVED</h1>
    <p>Envision is built on the generosity of donors who believe in empowering our youth through access to technology and educational opportunities. They represent hope, access, and a first step out of poverty through education and skills. Though you may never meet the child who receives your donated tech, know that you are empowering the next generation of leaders and innovators. You are giving the gift of possibility to someone who never had a chance. Donate your technology today and kindle a spark of joy, wonder, and opportunity in a young life. Together, we can empower the leaders of tomorrow, one laptop and one child at a time. Your small act of kindness can change the world for another. Donate today and bridge the digital divide!</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="reach-out">
  <h2 class="section-title">Reach out to us</h2>
  <p class="reach-out__lede">If you'd like to help, the best first step is an email. Tell us a little about yourself and what you have in mind, and we'll work out together where to go from there.</p>
  <ul class="reach-out__ideas">
    <li><strong>Laptops and tablets</strong> Have devices your school, company or family no longer uses?</li>
    <li><strong>Partnerships</strong> Know a school that needs a lab, or an organization that could work with us?</li>
    <li><strong>Anything else</strong> Questions, ideas, or just want to hear more about what we do.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="reach-out__cta">
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject={{ mailSubject }}">Email Envision</a>
  </p>
  <p class="reach-out__email"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject={{ mailSubject }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
</section>
